# The DDS stack this bridge is built against.
#
# ⭐ OUR OWN FILE, not eProsima's. Theirs - ddsenabler.repos in the Enabler
# repository - pins BRANCHES: master for Fast-CDR and Fast-DDS, main for
# dev-utils, DDS-Pipe and the Enabler itself. Building from it means building
# whatever those branches held at that moment, so two builds a week apart are
# two different pieces of software, a green nightly says nothing about
# tomorrow's, and a commit of eProsima's can redden our image with no change of
# ours - looking exactly like our bug.
#
# These versions are the ones this bridge has actually been built and tested
# against: they are what is installed on the development machine, and they
# match the pins orion-ld carries, which is a second deployment's worth of
# evidence that the combination works.
#
# ⚠ THE ENABLER IS PINNED TO A COMMIT, and it has to be. Three facts, each
# checked rather than assumed:
#
#   The bridge was developed against append_action_infix @ c44b086 - a branch
#   eProsima ASKED people to use and has since DELETED. It is absent from
#   `git ls-remote`, so a clean clone cannot fetch it, and pinning what was
#   tested would pin something unobtainable.
#
#   That work is on main as ad19575, "Append action infix to action topics"
#   (#29), which IS an ancestor of origin/main. `git diff c44b086 ad19575` over
#   ddsenabler, ddsenabler_participants and ddsenabler_yaml is EMPTY: it is the
#   same code, reachable.
#
#   And no release contains it. v1.2.0 differs by one line in
#   ddsenabler_participants Constants.hpp - the ACTION_INFIX that builds action
#   topic names. A tag would not fail to build; it would quietly produce
#   different topic names, which is worse.
#
# So ad19575 is at once what was tested, what orion-ld ships, and what a clean
# clone can get. Those three agreeing is the only reason to be comfortable here.
# Verified by cloning the repository fresh and checking the commit out.
#
# ▶ IT CAN STOP BEING A RAW COMMIT when eProsima cuts a release containing it:
#
#     git tag --contains ad19575d8b6691c9d46c53733ac040e6afeca998
#
# Anything that prints is a tag to move to. Nothing printing means there is
# still no release with the action infix in it, and this stays as it is.
#
# To move the stack: change a version here, run the nightly, and read what it
# says. That is the whole procedure, and it is the reason this file exists.

repositories:
    foonathan_memory_vendor:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/foonathan_memory_vendor.git
        version: v1.3.1
    fastcdr:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/Fast-CDR.git
        version: v2.3.0
    fastdds:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/Fast-DDS.git
        version: v3.3.0
    dev-utils:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/dev-utils.git
        version: v1.3.0
    ddspipe:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/DDS-Pipe.git
        version: v1.3.0
    ddsenabler:
        type: git
        url: https://github.com/eProsima/FIWARE-DDS-Enabler.git
        version: ad19575d8b6691c9d46c53733ac040e6afeca998
